  "summary": "Setting `CURLOPT_AWS_SIGV4` to NULL but does not disable SigV4 authentication,",
  "details": "Setting `CURLOPT_AWS_SIGV4` to NULL but does not disable SigV4 authentication,\ncontrary to expectations and documentation. A subsequent transfer on the same\nhandle still sends an `Authorization: AWS4-HMAC-SHA256` header to whatever URL\nisset next, leaking state information.",
